[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2544461417","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100439#issuecomment-2544461417","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100439","id":2544461417,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6XqWZp","user":{"login":"jinyangcruise","id":42859362,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyODU5MzYy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42859362?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise","html_url":"https://github.com/jinyangcruise","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-16T03:16:20Z","updated_at":"2024-12-16T03:16:20Z","body":"Reproducible in v4.2.stable.official [46dc27791].\n\nNot reproducible in v4.3.stable.official [77dcf97d8].\nNot reproducible in v4.4.dev6.official [1f47e4c4e].\n\nNot test on v4.2.2.stable.official.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2544461417/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2544498333","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100439#issuecomment-2544498333","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100439","id":2544498333,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Xqfad","user":{"login":"FrasherGray","id":59066601,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5MDY2NjAx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59066601?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrasherGray","html_url":"https://github.com/FrasherGray","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrasherGray/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrasherGray/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrasherGray/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrasherGray/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrasherGray/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrasherGray/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrasherGray/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrasherGray/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrasherGray/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-16T03:41:14Z","updated_at":"2024-12-16T04:01:56Z","body":"~~I guess I'm updating, then. Thank you for your thoroughness.~~\n\nNo, it does not work in v4.3.stable.official.\n\nIf you change the project very slightly:\n- move the button to be specifically the child of NodeThree, and change NodeThree's script to say\n```\nvar endManually: int = -1\n\nfunc takeTurn():\n\tendManually += 1\n\tif endManually == 3:\n\t\tendManually = 0\n\tif endManually == 0:\n\t\tget_node(\"Continue\").set_disabled(false)\n\telse:\n\t\tget_node(\"Continue\").set_disabled(true)\n\t\tnode2.endTurn()\n```\n(The button's name is Continue)\nThen you will see that it only works the first time. It might not throw any error, but the issue seems to remain under the hood.\n\nEdit:\nYou also need to increase the number of iterations in the for loop within `beginRound()`, otherwise the issue isn't truly evident.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2544498333/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2544554491","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100439#issuecomment-2544554491","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100439","id":2544554491,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6XqtH7","user":{"login":"FrasherGray","id":59066601,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5MDY2NjAx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59066601?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrasherGray","html_url":"https://github.com/FrasherGray","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrasherGray/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrasherGray/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrasherGray/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrasherGray/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrasherGray/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrasherGray/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrasherGray/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrasherGray/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrasherGray/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-16T04:12:17Z","updated_at":"2024-12-16T04:12:17Z","body":"I tested the updated code in Godot v4.4-dev6 and it produces the same result as in v4.3.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2544554491/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart